Package: qore-xml-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-xml-module-doc
Description: XML, SOAP, WebDAV and XML data providers for Qore
 This package includes XML parsing, generation and validation, WSDL/SOAP,
 XML-RPC, WebDAV, streaming and data-provider integrations. It provides all
 source and compiled Qore modules, compiler metadata, resources, translations,
 schemas, and the soaputil and webdav-server command-line tools.

Package: qore-xml-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-xml-module
Description: documentation for Qore's XML and web service modules
 This package contains the native XML and Qore module API references,
 tutorials and examples for XML, SOAP, XML-RPC and WebDAV applications.
